QX37uGXvY9qbGrUz3IstH2ZaE-oDj3VKMy2w3YSQJw&oe=6AAE8D46"}, "display_name": "Mixed Snow Worlds", "keywords": ["Colocated", "FreeRoam", "snow", "mixed", "mr"], "long_description": "# Transform Your Home into an Immersive Icy Wonderland \u2744\ufe0f\u2728\n\n**Welcome to Mixed Snow Worlds**, an innovative auto-adaptive **Mixed Reality** game that transforms your home into a magical icy realm! Your entire environment with all objects becomes part of an icy and fully immersive free roam MR and VR experience. \n\n{1258471482128671}\n###\nIt's all up to you: Armed with a **trusty snow cannon** and a **special flashlight** that unveils the **hidden virtual world,** you embark on an journey to protect your home. \ud83c\udfe1\u2728\n###\nAdorable yet mischievous monsters pop through walls, eager to freeze everything with their chilly touch. \ud83e\uddca As you navigate through your familiar yet transformed space, every corner brims with excitement and icy surprises.\n###\n\n## **Why \"Mixed Snow Worlds\" is a Game-Changer**\nThe application **adapts** to your home's layout. Move freely in your space, interacting with your objects in a completely virtual world. Join forces with friends in a **unique collaborative  experience**. Formulate strategies and fight side by side, enhancing your defense against the icy invasion. \u2744\ufe0f\u2694\ufe0f\n\nIt's time to turn your world into a **snowy playground**! \u26c4\n###\n## **Key Features:**\n- **Auto-Adaptive Mixed Reality** transforms your living space into a virtual ice battleground with the power of **2Sync SDK**.\n- Seamlessly transition between **Mixed Reality and full immersion**.\n- Defend against dimension-hopping enemies with your **snow cannon** and **flashlight**.\n- **Collaborate in location-based co-op gameplay** to strategize and defeat the icy invaders.\n\n##\n**Other Games:**\n- House Defender\n- The Last Galaxy", "short_description": "Your Home - Enchantingly Frozen. Welcome to \"Mixed Snow Worlds,\" an innovative auto-adaptive Mixed Reality game that transforms your home into a magical icy realm! It's all up to you: Armed with a trusty snow cannon and a special flashlight that unveils the hidden virtual world, you embark on an enchanting journey to protect your home. Adorable yet mischievous monsters pop through walls, eager to freeze everything with their chilly touch."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://2sync.io/appinfo/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://2sync.io/appinfo/", "publisher_name": "2Sync", "support_website_url": "https://2sync.io/discord", "website_url": "https://2sync.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8575977455836757"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_2386851084840617_6657041059187813207_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlzpsAvGlpUQ7kNvwG1__zg&_nc_oc=AdrmCxEIT8Z8EB8t8xwITlkh18TzT0FfCRsZxbfAoC_TajVVYSaXy9oPEDdHzj4Ipbk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKwXI39KszG_iKrL1DhnlJpyBBr0cFn22GrBd90e2ElsA&oe=6AAE8A22"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Mixed Snow Worlds", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "